    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-04: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.35";
    dc:description "Available enumerations allow bounded estimates but leave many members unclassified. The asserted overwhelming fraction and cross-family scope require major new mathematical results and explicit measures.";
