    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For each precisely defined rule family and size distribution, classify obvious simplicity and prove or disprove universality for the remaining rules, then calculate the asymptotic universal fraction.";
